            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Katonda nti, Ndi mulabe w'obulogo bwo, bw'okozesa okuteega abantu ng'ateega ebinyonyi, era ndibaggya mu mikono gyo. Ndinunula abantu be wateega ng'ebinyonyi n'obasiba.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.13.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
